+  # Single source of truth for KRE containment. Loaded by the handler at
+  # startup (env KRE_RULE_PLANS). Only rules listed here are remediated;
+  # any other alert is audited as unsupported and left alone.
+  # Must match the rule names in gitops/platform/dev/falco/values.yaml
+  # (customRules) and k8s/runtime-tests/scenarios.tsv; enforced by
